# A32.2: Prevent credentials, secrets, and build artifacts from being
# copied into Docker images if a Dockerfile is added in future.
# Without this file, a naive `COPY . .` would ship runner credentials
# (e.g. ~/.aws/credentials written by backup.yml) into the image.

# ── Secrets & credentials ────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
!.dev.vars.example
secrets-template.env
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# ── Git & CI ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.github
.gitignore

# ── Dependencies & build output ─────────────────────────────────────
node_modules
.next
.open-next
.vercel
.wrangler
dist
out
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── IDE & OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Test & tooling ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
__tests__
e2e
*.test.ts
*.test.tsx
*.spec.ts
*.spec.tsx
.semgrep
.gitleaks.toml
.gitleaksignore
.husky
load-test.js
lighthouserc.cjs

# ── Documentation ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
docs
*.md
!README.md
LICENSE
NOTICE.md

# ── Terraform / IaC ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
terraform
infra
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
